::MCQ::
Which math module function rounds a number up to the nearest integer?
{
~ round()
~ floor()
= ceil()
~ sqrt()
}

::MCQ::
What does math.pow(2, 3) calculate?
{
~ 2 multiplied by 3
= 2 raised to the power of 3
~ Square root of 2 and 3
~ 2 divided by 3
}

::MCQ::
What is a way to import only a specific function from the math module?
{
~ import math.sqrt
= from math import sqrt
~ use math.sqrt
~ include sqrt from math
}

::MCQ::
The math module is part of Python's standard library.
{
= True
~ False
}

